# Kasi-Tech Solutions

**In pursuit of digital excellence**

A multi-page company website for **Kasi-Tech Solutions**, a technology consulting firm based in Motherwell, Gqeberha (Nelson Mandela Bay), South Africa.

The site showcases the company’s services, team, history, and provides fully integrated enquiry and contact forms with custom client-side validation and automated email dispatch for local small-to-medium enterprises.

---

# Kasi-Tech Website Overview

An HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript-powered website created to present the business, promote its technology services, and give customers seamless ways to submit inquiries, quotation requests, and booking requests via EmailJS.

## Pages

| Page | File | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Home | `index.html` | Hero banner, service highlights, and call-to-action |
| About Us | `pages/about.html` | Company history, mission, vision, values, and team members |
| Services | `pages/services.html` | Detailed overview of core service offerings (Web Dev, Network, Database & Systems) |
| Enquiry | `pages/enquiry.html` | Full consultation / quotation request form with custom inline validation |
| Contact Us | `pages/contactus.html` | Callback form, contact details, opening hours, and embedded Google Map |

---

